WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:06.320
The girl was lying to her own heart.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.750
Her heart was screaming.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.260
It screamed its desire for the
real her to be known.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.330
It screamed its desire for
the real her to be seen.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.270
Her heart wished to scream
as loudly as it could...

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:26.000
<i>My real name is...</i>

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.970
Hinata-chan!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.240
Good morning!

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.870
Morning, Hinata-chan!

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.730
G-Good morning...

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:17.500
<b>Seventh Hour: Hotaru</b>

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:21.920
Here.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:25.440
Thank you, Kohinata-san!

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:31.350
K-Kohinata... Um...
Could you help me, too?

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.930
I don't really get this part...

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.310
Okay.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.630
You're really good at that!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.940
I've been doing it since I was a kid.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.780
Wow, you really are good!

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.210
A yukata?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.620
It's almost time for the summer festival.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:53.510
All the girls are going to
wear handmade yukata!

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.620
All the girls?

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.550
All the girls!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:58.960
Why, you—

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.770
Stupid thread!

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.500
Listen to your human masters!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.530
Why don't you ask for help, Yui-chan?

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.370
Not from her!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:13.970
W-Well... If she insisted, I might.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.040
No.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.180
Hey!

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.980
Help me, too!

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.850
What's wrong, Hinata-chan?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.540
Having problems?

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.150
Want her to help you, as well?

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:32.170
I-It's fine.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:35.630
It was your suggestion that
we all make yukata.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.660
Oh, it was?

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:41.370
You always have the best ideas, Hinata-chan.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:43.330
Hinata-chan, look at this!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.910
I'm glad...

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:58.080
Yui-chan stopped bullying you.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.020
Yeah.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.860
<i>Give them back!</i>

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:02.950
<i>Give back my grandfather!</i>

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.790
<i>All the people in the village who died!</i>

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.250
<i>All the people who died, crying!</i>

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.960
<i>Give them all back!</i>

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.260
<i>Who cares if you had
your house burned down?</i>

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.250
<i>That's what you deserve!</i>

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.320
<i>I won't pity you, no matter
how sad you look!</i>

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:19.740
<i>I'll despise and hate you, for my grandfather,
who isn't here anymore!</i>

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:31.150
It's taking time, but everyone else is
also opening up to you.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.750
I think it's thanks to Hinata-chan.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:39.120
It's been ever since you started
hanging out with her.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.730
N-No, that's not...

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:43.160
Thanks, Hinata-chan.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.100
Bye, Hinata-chan.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.340
See you tomorrow.

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:51.370
Yes...

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.160
Kagura.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.660
Thank you, Hinata.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.840
<i>This is my younger sister's...
Hotaru's room.</i>

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:32.600
<i>Oh, I didn't know you had a sister.</i>

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.570
<i>She died. A long time ago.</i>

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.680
<b>Sketchbook</b>

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.720
<b>The Story of the
TimeSound Spirit</b>

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.000
What are you doing?

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.310
I told you never to come in here!

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:44.020
I heard you were with the Kohinata girl again.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:50.550
You're a shame to the family.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.510
Grandfather!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.690
Hinata...

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.840
Hotaru... Hotaru...

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.580
Ouch! Grandfather!

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:24.190
Just you dare say that word again!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:27.390
Were you not going to carry
out her last wishes?

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:31.300
Were you not going to protect
this house for her?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.210
But...

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:36.560
Were you not going to live as Kagura Hinata?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.000
Well, Hotaru?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.380
I'll go and get you a flower, Hotaru!

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.890
Okay!

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.870
Why, Hinata...

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.500
To think that Hotaru would be
the one to survive...

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.940
The Kagura family is done for.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.780
We cannot let them know.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:24.780
We mustn't let the villagers find out the truth.

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.220
Hotaru is dead.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.720
Hotaru is the one who died.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.630
You are Hinata.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.990
You must be Hinata.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.450
For the village...

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.280
For the Kagura family...

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:44.270
You must become Hinata.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.040
That's what Hinata would have wanted.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.340
My sister...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.070
Yes.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:57.130
Not just your sister.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.140
Myself...

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.490
And the people of the village...

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.390
Everyone...

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.320
They want Hinata to survive.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.940
Become Hinata.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.250
For your sister...

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.630
For the Kagura family...

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.590
No, for the entire village...

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.300
You must become Hinata.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.440
<b>Funeral
for Kagura
Hotaru</b>

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:45.950
Did you not swear to become Hinata?

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.810
To abandon being Hotaru,

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.200
to become Hinata?

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.200
I will not allow you to go back to being Hotaru!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:03.990
No, even if you were to now,
the villagers wouldn't accept you.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.830
The village needs the Kagura family.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.790
They need Kagura Hinata.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.160
I forbid you to go outside for a while!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.770
Compose yourself.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.050
<i>Hello. I'm Kagura Hinata!</i>

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.070
<i>What a well-bred young girl.</i>

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.460
<i>The girls of the Kagura family
are truly extraordinary.</i>

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.450
<i>Who's that?</i>

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:46.890
<i>Hotaru...</i>

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:49.170
<i>Hotaru, introduce yourself!</i>

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.170
<i>Hotaru!</i>

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:57.800
<i>The elder of the Kagura sisters,
Hinata, is well-behaved, but...</i>

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.760
<i>But with the younger Hotaru as she is,</i>

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.070
<i>I worry about who will be
the future Village Head.</i>

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:09.980
<i>Here.</i>

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.590
<i>Did you know?</i>

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:14.110
<i>Candy tastes like happiness.</i>

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.350
<i>When you lick it,
flowers bloom in your mouth.</i>

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.200
<i>Are you drawing a picture book again?</i>

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:28.990
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:30.470
<i>What kind of story is it this time?</i>

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.300
<i>It's the story of the TimeSound Spirit.</i>

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.420
<i>The story of the TimeSound Spirit?</i>

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.890
<i>The TimeSound Spirit, Otoha-chan,</i>

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:48.340
<i>joins in friendship the Promised One with
the villagers, who have been fighting.</i>

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.950
<i>And she makes the village happy.</i>

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.920
<i>The Promised One?</i>

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:55.280
<i>No one can see her.</i>

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>But the Promised One can!</i>

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.730
<i>She has to find the Promised One</i>

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.760
<i>and make the villagers happy,</i>

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.470
<i>or she can't return to the spirit world.</i>

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:07.650
<i>That sounds neat!</i>

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:12.420
<i>But what happens to the Promised One?</i>

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:16.400
<i>Well, if Otoha-chan goes
back to the spirit world,</i>

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.540
<i>the Promised One is all alone, right?</i>

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.340
<i>That's kinda sad.</i>

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.420
<i>Y-Yeah.</i>

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.440
<i>When it's all done, show
it to me first, okay?</i>

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.760
<i>I'm looking forward to it!</i>

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:14.180
Hinata's missed school for three days.

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:18.500
Yeah... The teacher said she's sick.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.220
It's my fault.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:23.170
Because she got close to me and stuff, she...

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.360
Hayami-chan...

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.120
I should never have involved
myself with you two.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.050
I think Hinata would be sad if she heard that!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:33.270
Then what do we do?!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.490
Hinata's going to...

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.190
Let's go see her at home.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.600
If we talk to her directly, I'm sure...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.640
The only thing I can do is stay away from her.

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.940
There's nothing else I can do...

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.310
<i>It's not that you can't do it.</i>

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.120
<i>You just think you can't.</i>

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.980
<i>Otoha-chan...</i>

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.100
You just think there's nothing else you can do!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.820
I was the same.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.590
But I got to be friends with you.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:11.260
And you two are back to being
friends now, aren't you?

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:14.500
Th-That's true, but...

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.210
We've come this far.
I don't want to give up!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.440
Let's figure out what we can do!

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.740
Let's try to do what we can!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.540
<b>Kagura Hinata!</b>

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.470
<b>Yes!</b>

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.410
<b>Well done, Hinata.</b>

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.350
<b>You're amazing, Hinata-chan!!</b>

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.660
<b>It's Hinata-sama! Hinata-sama! She's so wonderful!</b>

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:24.770
You can tell she's the Kagura family heir.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.270
I know it's not nice to say,

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.950
but I'm glad it was Hotaru-sama who died.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.610
You're right about that.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:32.770
Hinata-chan...

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:35.540
Hinata!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.280
Hey, Hinata-chan!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.020
Hinata-chan!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.500
Hinata...

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:23.930
<b>Sketchbook
Kagura Hotaru</b>

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.130
<b>Sketchbook
Kagura Hotaru</b>

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.750
Hello?

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.040
Here are the notes for the classes you missed.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.490
Get better!

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:11.100
Everyone's waiting!

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.860
Get back here soon!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.440
"Are you scared of competing

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:18.880
with me for the Yukata Queen title?"

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:21.950
...is what Yui-chan's saying,
so come back, okay?

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.970
Of course, I'm waiting for you, too!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.200
What's this?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.610
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:48.050
<i>There wasn't much time left,
so I made a yukata for you.</i>

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.490
<i>I hope it fits...</i>

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.610
<i>No matter what happens,</i>

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:55.420
<i>I'm with you.</i>

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.710
<i>Not just me...</i>

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.600
<i>Hirose, Yui, and the others...</i>

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.990
<i>We're all on your side.</i>

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.460
<i>Hirose told me that you shouldn't just</i>

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.420
<i>tell yourself you can't do something...</i>

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.920
<i>That we may not know what we can do,</i>

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.650
<i>but we should do what we can.</i>

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.110
<i>At least, I can tell you how I feel.</i>

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:19.220
<i>I can tell you that we're here with you.</i>

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:29.320
<b>You shouldn't just tell yourself you can't do something.</b>

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:24.310
<i>Let's all go to the summer
festival together.</i>

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:26.570
<i>Everyone's waiting.</i>

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:27.920
<i>Let's all go together...</i>

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.540
<i>Grandpa said to stop drawing pictures?</i>

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.990
<i>Why?</i>

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:42.700
<i>He said I need to study and be like you...</i>

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.900
<i>Why do you need to be like me?</i>

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:49.300
<i>B-Because I'm a useless girl.</i>

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.780
<i>Why are you a useless girl?</i>

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:55.440
<i>Because I'm not good at school,</i>

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.940
<i>and I don't have any friends.</i>

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:02.520
<i>I'm not good at sports,
and I don't like carrots.</i>

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:08.380
<i>And sometimes I still wet the bed...</i>

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:11.330
<i>Yeah, maybe you...</i>

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.550
<i>No, no!</i>

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:16.600
<i>I can't draw like this!</i>

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:22.820
<i>Yeah... I can't write
wonderful stories like this.</i>

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:25.680
<i>You're fine as you are, Hotaru.</i>

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.040
<i>I love your picture books.</i>

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:30.980
<i>I want you to keep writing them.</i>

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.920
<i>But... But...</i>

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.620
<i>Grandfather and the others</i>

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.330
<i>don't know the real you. That's all.</i>

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.890
<i>I know!</i>

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.390
<i>I'll show them your book!</i>

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.860
<i>I'm sure they'll love you!</i>

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:48.060
<i>But... But...</i>

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:52.520
<i>You're thinking that it's
impossible, aren't you?</i>

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.830
<i>Stop that!</i>

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.610
<i>I hate it when you're like that!</i>

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.930
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.760
<i>You think you're the kind of girl</i>

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.010
<i>who can't do anything, right?</i>

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:07.220
<i>Bzzt! That's way wrong!</i>

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.920
<i>It's not that you can't do it.</i>

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.150
<i>It's just that you think you can't.</i>

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:16.220
<i>I know all about you.</i>

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.120
<i>I know you're a good girl.</i>

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.750
<i>So it's fine!</i>

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.080
<i>Stay just as you are...</i>

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.990
<b>Sketchbook
Kagura Hotaru</b>

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:46.920
Hinata?

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.150
Hinata-chan!

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:53.130
Hinata-chan!

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.440
Hinata-chan?

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.740
I'm Kagura Hotaru!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.610
H-Hinata?

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:10.410
My... My name is Kagura Hotaru!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.480
<b>Sketchbook
Kagura Hotaru</b>

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:22.310
And then the TimeSound Spirit
went on a journey,

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:23.530
back to the spirit world.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:26.930
So what happened to the Promised One?

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:31.310
Was he alone then?

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:34.300
No.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:37.660
Because he had tried so hard
with the TimeSound Spirit,

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.990
everyone now loved him.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:45.980
The Promised One made many friends.

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:52.110
And in his heart was born a great,

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:56.760
great courage, which would
never yield to anything.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:21:59.450
The end.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.100
Hotaru?

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:06.240
Hey, Hotaru!

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.570
Hotaru-chan!

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:26.640
It's a wonderful story, isn't it, Hotaru?

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:02.320
I live with my fiancé, Takuma-kun,

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:05.210
and his sisters, Hayami-chan and Hotaru-chan!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.400
I'm magical girl Magical Otoha!

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.590
Another magical girl has appeared!

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:12.380
It's the beginning of the magical girl wars!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:15.030
<b>Eighth Hour: Otoha</b>

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.620
What kind of story is that?
